===== la-folium/SUMMARY.md =====
     1	STATUS: PROVED-candidate
     2	For the fixed bare A2/D1(e′) kink and a common-unbroken selected circle, injectivity realizes every nearby rotated junction as a continuously varying local vector in the same GNS folium.
     3	Purity makes the representation irreducible; the resulting locally C¹ projective implementers are explicitly rephased and extended to a strongly continuous unitary group.
     4	D26 makes the 2π automorphism trivial, so the Stone generator has scalar 2π exponential and pure-point spectrum in one integer coset.
     5	This is not a window-charge limit: nonscalar virtual circles still trigger the on-folium non-Cauchy obstruction of memory-index.md ⟨1⟩12.
     6	Scope excludes arbitrary D1(e′) core modifications unless their padded blocked tensors have full virtual span.
     7	Main shard: folium-implementer.md.
     8	PATCH.md targets theory/memory-index.md and claims/CLAIMS.md; no definitions or notation edits.

