   207	## ⟨1⟩6. Delta-normalized one-magnon kernel beyond the product vacuum
   208	
   209	This section addresses the `tns-iu5` sub-task named in the lane brief.  It is
   210	conditional on the exact-band hypothesis D31; it does not assert that a
   211	generic variational excitation tensor satisfies D31.
   212	
   213	**ASSUME.** D31(1)--(2), with multiplicity `m`, and use the rigging
   214	
   215	`C^∞(𝕋;ℂ^m) ⊂ L²(𝕋,dk/(2π);ℂ^m) ⊂ 𝒟'(𝕋;ℂ^m)`.
   216	
   217	**PROVE.** There are generalized one-magnon kernels `|k,b⟩`, `1≤b≤m`,
   218	unique up to a measurable unitary change of multiplicity frame, such that
   219	
   220	`Γ_M f=Σ_b∫(dk/(2π)) f_b(k)|k,b⟩`,
   221	
   222	`⟨k,b|k',b'⟩=2πδ(k-k')δ_{bb'}`,
   223	
   224	`H|k,b⟩=ω(k)|k,b⟩`,
