   230	`Φ_M:=Γ_M C^∞(𝕋;ℂ^m)`.  For each `(k,b)` define the continuous evaluation
   231	functional `|k,b⟩∈Φ_M'` by
   232	
   233	`⟨Γ_M g|k,b⟩:=overline{g_b(k)}`.
   234	
