   364	
   365	**PROVE.**  The quantized outcome and ordered-law conclusions of ⟨1⟩1 and
   366	⟨1⟩4 hold without `(H-split)`, `(H-AD-edge)`, charge conservation, definite
   367	channel charges, or `(H-dress)`.
   368	
