   370	
   371	*Justification.*  The exhaustive leaves ⟨1⟩1.⟨2⟩1--⟨2⟩6 cite only
   372	D19--D20, D26, automorphic spectrum invariance, and live claim
   373	**M-INDEX-fin**.
   374	
   375	**⟨2⟩2.**  The ordered-law conclusion adds only `(E-LR1)--(E-LR3)`.
   376	
   377	*Justification.*  The exhaustive leaves ⟨1⟩4.⟨2⟩1--⟨2⟩5 cite only
   378	**LR1-GEN**, **M-INDEX-fin**, **M-INDEX-spec**, and the clauses explicitly
   379	displayed in (T4).
   380	
   381	**⟨2⟩3.**  None of the five excluded hypotheses can be hidden in a cited
   382	donor claim.
   383	
   384	*Justification.*  The adjudicated scope of **M-INDEX-fin** expressly uses
   385	finite-window offset cancellation; **M-INDEX-spec** expressly assumes D27
   386	and states that H-AD-G is needed only for its separate channel reduction;
