   723	## ⟨1⟩6. SPT-M' — protected edge memory, with the dynamical gap exposed
   724	
   725	### ⟨2⟩1. Conditional charge-bookkeeping theorem
   726	
   727	**ASSUME.**  (H-split), (H-AD-edge), conservation of the chosen `U(1)` charge,
   728	and asymptotic channels with definite bulk and edge charges.
   729	
   730	**PROVE.**  On every channel,
   731	
   732	`ΔQ_edge=-(Q_bulk,out-Q_bulk,in)`.                               **(6.1)**
   733	
   734	Consequently the channel spectrum lies in
   735	`(q_{ω,C}^∘+ℤ)-(q_{ω,C}^∘+ℤ)=ℤ` (or the corresponding finite set after restricting the edge
   736	multiplet).  For the AKLT doublet it is contained in `{-1,0,+1}`.  Expectations
   737	are convex combinations and need not be integers.
   738	
   739	**⟨3⟩1.** By (H-AD-edge), `Q_tot=Q_edge+Q_bulk` on both asymptotic channel
   740	spaces.  **Justification:** `Sd10'`.
