   742	**⟨3⟩2.** Conservation gives `Q_tot,out-Q_tot,in=0`; rearrangement gives (6.1).
   743	**Justification:** the assumed `U(1)` symmetry; exact charge bookkeeping, the
   744	same mechanism as M-quant but with edge charge replacing wall position.
