   746	**⟨3⟩3.** SPT-E'(iii) puts edge eigenvalues in `q_{ω,C}^∘+ℤ`; taking differences
   747	gives the stated channel lattice.  **Justification:** ⟨1⟩4.⟨2⟩3.
   748	
