   348	## 3. Why this does not revive M-INDEX-LA-strong
   349	
   350	### ⟨1⟩7. PROPOSITION FOL-FENCE (implementer route versus window route)
   351	
   352	**ASSUME.**  The theorem ⟨1⟩6 and, when invoked, the nonscalar-tail
   353	hypothesis of `theory/memory-index.md` ⟨1⟩12.
   354	
   355	**PROVE.**  ⟨1⟩6 is compatible with the REFUTED claim
   356	M-INDEX-LA-strong, including its on-folium mechanism B.
   357	
   358	**⟨2⟩1.**  The unitaries in ⟨1⟩6 are obtained from folium equivalence:
   359	locally, `W_θπ(A)Ω=π(γ_θ(A))ξ_{-θ}`, with `ξ_{-θ}` represented by one fixed
   360	finite-block operator.  No sequence `Q̂_{W,c_0}` and no spatial exhaustion is
   361	used.
