   369	strengthening is proved in `theory/memory-index.md` ⟨1⟩12 from the positive
   370	shell limit `2(1-|tr(V_{θ_0}r)|²)`.  ⟨1⟩6 constructs `U` by a different
   371	route.
   372	
   373	**⟨2⟩3.**  There is no contradiction: an implementing unitary is determined
   374	only up to a scalar, but it is not required to be the strong limit of any
   375	chosen inner approximants.  Here the bare windows retain two virtual endpoint
   376	excitations as their boundaries recede, whereas the GNS construction fixes
   377	the automorphism directly and absorbs the rotated junction into `ξ_{-θ}`.
   378	
   379	*Justification.*  Uniqueness modulo scalars is ⟨1⟩4.⟨2⟩4; failure of the
   380	specific approximants is ⟨2⟩2; the finite-junction representative is
   381	⟨1⟩1--⟨1⟩2.  This exact logical separation is named **FOL-FENCE.1**.
   382	
   383	**⟨2⟩4.**  Mechanism A of M-INDEX-LA-strong remains outside the theorem:
   384	its state has logarithmically divergent fluctuations and its circle orbit is
   385	disjoint, while §0 fixes the single A2 representation whose circle orbit is
   386	normal by ⟨1⟩2.
   387	
   388	*Justification.*  Claim M-INDEX-LA-strong and
   389	`theory/memory-index.md` ⟨1⟩3, versus ⟨1⟩2 here.
