The folium implementer proof survives. The key construction is local and exact: injectivity makes the padded junction block span the full virtual matrix algebra, so a nearby rotated junction is a vector in the original GNS folium. Purity then yields a continuous projective implementer, and the one-parameter cocycle is explicitly removed before applying Stone’s theorem.
