    57	**⟨2⟩3. QED.**
    58	
    59	**⟨1⟩2. PROVE.**  Every three-wall configuration in the sector is uniquely
    60	of the form
    61	
    62	`w(σ)=(a,a+ℓ,μ+ℓ)`, with `A≤a≤μ-1` and
    63	`1≤ℓ≤B-1-μ`.
    64	
    65	**⟨2⟩1.**  For walls `a<b<c`, the down spins occupy the finite block
    66	`a+1,…,b` and the right tail `c+1,…,B`, so their number is
    67	`(b-a)+(B-c)`.
