    77	**⟨2⟩3.**  The strict inequalities and finite-volume bounds are equivalent
    78	to `A≤a≤μ-1` and `1≤ℓ≤B-1-μ`; conversely every pair in this rectangle gives
    79	one admissible word.
    80	
    81	*Justification.*  ⟨2⟩2 and the D16 product-basis ordering of wall bonds.
    82	
    83	**⟨2⟩4. QED.**
    84	
    85	**⟨1⟩3.**  Thus the entire fixed-charge `≤3`-wall space consists of `K_μ`
    86	and the rectangle in ⟨1⟩2; no configuration has been omitted.
    87	
    88	*Justification.*  ⟨1⟩1--⟨1⟩2 and the definition of `P_3` cited in claim
    89	Mq-AD3.
