   157	## 3. Left/right legs and charges
   158	
   159	Set `m:=μ+1`, so the negative graph tail has a sharp background kink at the
   160	incoming bond `m`.
   161	
   162	**⟨1⟩1. PROVE.**  For `n≤0`, `L_n` is one down magnon at site `x=μ+n≤m-1`
   163	on the `↑` vacuum, together with the kink at bond `m`.
   164	
   165	**⟨2⟩1.**  The walls `(x-1,x,m)` enclose exactly the single down spin `x`
   166	before the final `↑↓` wall at `m`.
