   213	**⟨2⟩4. QED.**
   214	
   215	**⟨1⟩4.**  Under `U_∞`, negative-tail asymptotics are therefore the D14
   216	incoming/reflected channel and positive-tail asymptotics are the D14
   217	transmitted channel, with exactly the labels and charges required by Mq-E.
