   223	## 4. Connected-component enumeration
   224	
   225	**⟨1⟩1. PROVE.**  If the D16 XY term exchanges the antiparallel spins at a
   226	wall bond `r`, the new wall set is
   227	
   228	`w(σ')=w(σ) △ {r-1,r+1}`,
   229	
   230	with an attempted move through a frozen endpoint removed by the compression.
   231	
   232	**⟨2⟩1.**  The exchange changes only the comparisons across bonds `r-1` and
   233	`r+1`; the spins across bond `r` remain antiparallel.
   234	
   235	*Justification.*  Direct action of the D16 term
   236	`-(J/2)(S_r^+S_{r+1}^-+S_r^-S_{r+1}^+)` in its `S^z` product basis.
   237	
   238	**⟨2⟩2.**  Each of those two neighbouring wall indicators is therefore
   239	toggled, while every other indicator is unchanged.
