   259	**⟨2⟩3. QED.**
   260	
   261	**⟨1⟩3. PROVE.**  In the rectangle `(a,ℓ)` of §1, the non-isolated
   262	three-wall vertices are exactly its row `ℓ=1` and its column `a=μ-1`.
   263	
   264	**⟨2⟩1.**  The condition `b=a+1` is `ℓ=1`.
