   266	*Justification.*  §1 ⟨1⟩2 and D16.
   267	
   268	**⟨2⟩2.**  Because `c-b=(μ+ℓ)-(a+ℓ)=μ-a`, the condition `c=b+1` is
   269	`a=μ-1`.
   270	
   271	*Justification.*  §1 ⟨1⟩2 and D16.
   272	
   273	**⟨2⟩3.**  Every rectangle vertex with `ℓ≥2` and `a≤μ-2` is therefore an
