   785	`𝔉_{N,L}^{bulk}(ξ)=(W_out^{N,L})†Q[f_{L,κ}^{bulk};ξ]W_in^{N,L}`.
   786	Along a tensor path, every external tensor, channel embedding, tangent-space
   787	gauge fix, Gram normalization, and differentiated profile entering this
   788	formula is required to be continuous in the path parameter, or `C^p` when a
   789	coefficient through order `p` is asserted.
