   208	with an Ogata stability premise, but the latter has no local TeX, and the
   209	finite-group-to-compact-circle scope must be checked before promotion.
   210	
   211	**ASSUME.**
   212	
   213	1. A symmetric uniformly gapped path of one-dimensional interactions whose
   214	   pure invariant ground states are split, with half-chain projective class
   215	   constant under the corresponding factorized automorphic equivalence
