+**Adjudication: PROMOTE-к-PROVED for `SPT-M'-TPM-fin` and for `SPT-M'-TPM-spec` as an implication conditional on E-LR2--E-LR3; retain the former channel theorem separately as `SPT-M'-ch`.**

